// unity.scene.read, unity.object.create, unity.object.transform,
// unity.object.delete, unity.material.set`},{slug:`ai-assetra`,name:`ai-assetra`,group:`Integrations`,status:`planned`,summary:`Assetra tools: search, download, upload and manage 3D models in the shared library.`,purpose:`Assetra is the shared library of 3D models used by IT Kamianets games; 3d-unity-assetra works with it from inside Unity. With ai-assetra an agent finds a model for what the user describes, downloads it into the project, and publishes new models with their metadata.`,dependencies:[`ai-core`],version:``,license:`MIT`,packageId:`@itkamianets/ai-assetra`,install:`npm install @itkamianets/ai-assetra`,requirements:[`Node.js 24 LTS`,`ai-core`,`An Assetra account for uploads`],usage:`Add assetraTools() to the agent's tools. Searching and downloading work at once; uploading needs the user's Assetra account.`,current:[],features:[`Search by text, tags and size.`,`Download a model into a project folder.`,`Upload a model with its metadata.`,`Update and remove the user's own models.`],examples:[`Find a wooden chair, download it into the Unity project and place it with ai-unity.`],roadmap:[`Search and download`,`Upload with metadata`,`Manage the user's own models`,`Find a model and place it in the scene together with ai-unity`],related:[`ai-core`,`ai-unity`],optional:[],api:[{name:`assetraTools(options)`,text:`The Assetra tools for createAgent.`},{name:`assetra.search`,text:`Finds models by text, tags and size.`},{name:`assetra.download`,text:`Downloads a model into a folder of the project.`},{name:`assetra.upload`,text:`Publishes a model with its metadata. Needs the user's approval.`}],example:``},{slug:`ai-firebase`,name:`ai-firebase`,group:`Integrations`,status:`planned`,summary:`Firebase tools: Authentication, Firestore, Realtime Database and Cloud Storage for an agent.`,purpose:`A toolset that lets an agent work with a Firebase project properly, the way @angular/fire does for Angular apps: read and write data, manage users and files. It knows no project: t